msgctxt "108"
msgid "Thanks for coming out all the time. Here's a hot tip, just for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"A professional baseball player came and played here earlier. He was "
"incredible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"He was hitting so many balls, he broke our facility's high score. I mean, I "
"can't be too surprised. He is a pro, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"I should've gotten his autograph... Maybe he'll come back to play sometime? "
"I sure hope he does!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"(Professional baseball players come here? That's pretty neat... Maybe the "
"ladies at the hostess club would think so, too.)"
msgstr ""

